From: WinBoat
Subject: [PATCH] d3d10umd: views outside the rotation lists destroyed safely

Patch 0059 keeps render target and shader resource views in lists (a swap chain's rotation moves them) and took
each out at its destruction. Shader resource views made elsewhere are zeroed and in no list: an NV12/P010 plane's
(VideoCreateShaderResourceView) and raw/structured buffer views. Destroying one unlinked NULL pointers: dx-test's
video group crashed at the device's release after "Shader views of NV12 planes" (0xC0000005). A view is taken out
of its list only if it is in one.
---
diff --git a/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/Shader.cpp b/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/Shader.cpp
--- a/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/Shader.cpp
+++ b/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/Shader.cpp
@@ -1757,7 +1757,9 @@
 
    ShaderResourceView *pSRView = CastShaderResourceView(hShaderResourceView);
 
-   list_del(&pSRView->link);
+   /* (views made elsewhere aren't in the list: NV12/P010 planes and raw/structured buffer views, zeroed) */
+   if (pSRView->link.next)
+      list_del(&pSRView->link);
    pipe_sampler_view_reference(&pSRView->handle, NULL);
 }
 
diff --git a/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/OutputMerger.cpp b/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/OutputMerger.cpp
--- a/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/OutputMerger.cpp
+++ b/src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/OutputMerger.cpp
@@ -186,7 +186,8 @@
 
    RenderTargetView *pRTView = CastRenderTargetView(hRenderTargetView);
 
-   list_del(&pRTView->link);
+   if (pRTView->link.next)
+      list_del(&pRTView->link);
    pipe_surface_reference(&pRTView->surface, NULL);
 }
 
